  "totalBlocks": 68,
  "translatedBlocks": 67,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2af4d64020f963f9",
      "translationZh": "Claude Desktop 在 Amazon Bedrock 上提供强大的 AI 辅助，但由于缺少集成的网络搜索，响应仅限于模型的训练知识截止点。当您需要当前信息时，例如最近的文档更新、实时定价或天气更新，模型无法自行检索这些信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1711feb295eef9c0",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个平台，可在任何框架或模型下大规模构建、连接和优化代理。通过 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的能力 AgentCore Gateway，您可以通过将 Claude Desktop 连接到 Web Search 来弥合此知识截止差距。Web Search 是一种完全托管的、与 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 兼容的网络搜索功能，其后盾是覆盖数十亿文档的 Amazon 网络索引。所有查询流量均留在 AWS 基础设施内，无需管理外部 API 密钥，且查询不会离开您的边界。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4266a57453f929f7",
      "translationZh": "使用 Claude Desktop，您可以使用托管的 MCP 服务器连接到已启用 Web Search 目标的 AgentCore Gateway。在本文中，我们将逐步介绍设置此集成的步骤，并使用基于 JSON Web Token (JWT) 的入站身份验证来保护通信。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08956847b04dbfd0",
      "translationZh": "许多在 AWS 上运行的企业使用 AWS IAM Identity Center 进行单点登录（SSO）以访问其 AWS 账户。在本演练中，我们将 AWS IAM Identity Center 用作 AgentCore Gateway 的身份验证来源。通过此设置，Claude Desktop 在 Amazon Bedrock 上可以通过受信任的企业托管身份流调用 Web Search。此方法符合现有的组织身份治理。无需单独的凭据或第三方身份提供者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f52d344340be389",
      "translationZh": "为了将 AWS IAM Identity Center 与 AgentCore Gateway 的基于 JWT 的身份验证相连接，我们使用 Amazon Cognito 作为联合层，采用 OAuth 2.0 授权码授权流。IAM Identity Center 通过 Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML) 处理用户身份验证。Amazon Cognito 发放 JWT，而 AgentCore Gateway 在每个请求上验证这些 JWT。整个身份验证链均位于 AWS 内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da9ccab8d2190006",
      "translationZh": "以下序列图说明了此身份验证流程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6788fc289220ea0f",
      "translationZh": "图 1：用户身份验证和授权序列图",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b91583f589df7b3",
      "translationZh": "要跟随本文的步骤操作，您需要以下内容：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72d31ddfc0c4a2e8",
      "translationZh": "具有创建 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色和 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 资源权限的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe2cce3e49a7efae",
      "translationZh": "对 AWS Organizations 中管理账户的管理员访问权限（用于配置 AWS IAM Identity Center）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d9e9cf7ab4554b8",
      "translationZh": "已预配置用于 AWS 账户 SSO 访问的 AWS IAM Identity Center。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "18197cfbb67ad579",
      "translationZh": "已将 Amazon Bedrock 配置为推理提供程序的 Claude Desktop。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1abcb5d307e19390",
      "translationZh": "已安装并配置 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) v2。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c22f8dd0be7a2255",
      "translationZh": "Boto3 SDK 已更新至最新版本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0add323fb3ee9cb3",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的 Web Search 目前在美国东部（弗吉尼亚北部）AWS 区域（us-east-1）、欧洲（爱尔兰）区域（eu-west-1）和亚太地区（东京）区域（ap-northeast-1）可用。请确认您的网关是在其中一个区域创建的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a782308dca852b8",
      "translationZh": "配置包括设置身份验证链（AWS IAM Identity Center → Amazon Cognito → JWT），然后将 AgentCore Gateway 接入 Claude Desktop。我们将在以下章节中逐步介绍每一步。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f14cff36e7ba8591",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：创建 Amazon Cognito 用户池",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "524867c9c6fffde6",
      "translationZh": "在您的目标 AWS 账户中，创建一个 Amazon Cognito 用户池，该用户池将作为 AgentCore Gateway 的 OpenID Connect (OIDC) 令牌颁发者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63ecec2ffff72325",
      "translationZh": "保存这些值以供后续步骤使用：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "916e5ca55da8184a",
      "translationZh": "用户池 ID：USER_POOL_ID 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d2d8ea28395f37d",
      "translationZh": "域名：<your-unique-prefix>.auth.<region>.amazoncognito.com 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b10da45410448f8d",
      "translationZh": "受众：urn:amazon:cognito:sp:<user-pool-id> 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf6c5f019ba3e7ea",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：配置 IAM Identity Center SAML 应用程序",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05fc5b9ceb7c1aa8",
      "translationZh": "在您的 AWS Organizations 管理账户中，创建一个与 Cognito 联合的 SAML 应用程序。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48b42aa048e00df5",
      "translationZh": "打开 IAM Identity Center 控制台。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e46e0f1fb1020195",
      "translationZh": "选择 Applications , Add application , I have an application I want to set up , SAML 2.0 , 然后 Next .",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e4bd3afb00feec8",
      "translationZh": "填写以下详细信息：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7389fbfab298f492",
      "translationZh": "显示名称 : AgentCore Web Search。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ad83dd659c5f4a3",
      "translationZh": "选择 Manually type your metadata value 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce3c546b568fd08b",
      "translationZh": "下载 SAML metadata XML 文件并选择 Submit 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fc9176354cee16c",
      "translationZh": "创建应用程序后，编辑属性映射并插入以下值：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ea97a1794220d92",
      "translationZh": "主题，user:subject，格式：持久。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ad40d55ac1ba003",
      "translationZh": "电子邮件，user:email，格式：基本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "19c87b6fcd1e3229",
      "translationZh": "分配将拥有 Web Search 访问权限的用户或组。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f36efbd4f1ae27d2",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：将 SAML IdP 接入 Cognito",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0f4988d13ff3fcf",
      "translationZh": "返回目标账户，在您的 Cognito 用户池中将 IAM Identity Center 注册为 SAML 身份提供者：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bfa34eb551cb6d15",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：为 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 创建 Cognito 应用客户端",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e2b36bb2d82ccd8",
      "translationZh": "创建带有客户端密钥的应用客户端。Claude Desktop 使用此客户端启动 OAuth 流程，通过 IAM Identity Center 对用户进行身份验证，并获取 AgentCore Gateway 的 JWT。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02b9f47f41930daf",
      "translationZh": "记下输出中的客户端 ID 和客户端密钥。这些是您的应用客户端 ID 和密钥。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cb12df1371674b6b",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5：配置带有 Web Search 工具的 AgentCore Gateway",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6233d29ff191417a",
      "translationZh": "在此步骤中，我们创建一个新的 AgentCore Gateway，其入站身份验证类型为 JSON Web 令牌（JWT）。对于此配置，我们使用在之前步骤中创建的 Cognito 用户池 ID 和应用程序客户端 ID。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d46a8d5d2a312edd",
      "translationZh": "运行以下 Python 脚本以创建具有所需配置的网关，将所有占位符替换为您环境中的实际值。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f958df45f4a67596",
      "translationZh": "您现在拥有一个具备 Web Search 工具且使用 JWT 进行入站授权的 AgentCore Gateway。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1574f9d2a8eacac",
      "translationZh": "步骤 6：配置 Claude Desktop",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6eca772f75e6c24a",
      "translationZh": "按照 Claude Desktop 配置文档中的步骤打开用于 Amazon Bedrock 的 Claude Desktop 配置窗口。打开后，选择“连接器和扩展”，然后选择“添加服务器”，接着选择“空白”。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "200679c348e29ab6",
      "translationZh": "以下截图显示了包含这些选项的配置窗口。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8762f5501f0714ce",
      "translationZh": "图 2：Claude Desktop 连接器配置窗口",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e2abe7c27abd23b",
      "translationZh": "请输入以下详细信息：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9606caa212546c28",
      "translationZh": "传输 : 可流式 HTTP。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f29eb5019dd034f0",
      "translationZh": "URL : 输入在第 5 步中创建的 AgentCore 网关的网关资源 URL。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a863f1675bdf98df",
      "translationZh": "OAuth : 自带客户端。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37d270631a7fa504",
      "translationZh": "客户端 ID : 输入在第 4 步中创建的应用客户端的客户端 ID。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29092125b4cedf25",
      "translationZh": "客户端密钥 : 输入在第 4 步中创建的应用客户端的客户端密钥。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e22d189b2b21b8df",
      "translationZh": "授权服务器 : 输入 [\"https://<your-unique-prefix>.auth.<region>.amazoncognito.com/oauth2/authorize\"] 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e160001c9b9865b",
      "translationZh": "回调主机 : localhost 。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "23449f1058188d13",
      "translationZh": "回调端口 : 53280。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9923094ab843bf2b",
      "translationZh": "回到 Claude Desktop，您应该会看到类似以下图像所示的成功的 MCP 注册消息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e4f7c1bd46293b7",
      "translationZh": "图 3：Claude Desktop 中成功的 MCP 服务器注册",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51083dfd21f978b4",
      "translationZh": "Claude Desktop 将通过 MCP tools/list 调用发现 WebSearchTool。只要模型需要从网络获取最新信息，它就会自动调用该工具。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f065544d7f9caf85",
      "translationZh": "测试和验证",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6b4fd8700216d01",
      "translationZh": "在您首选的界面（例如 Chat 或 Cowork）中，发送一个需要 Claude Desktop 检索最新结果的查询。您应该会看到一个工具执行批准框，表明 Claude 已成功发现 Web Search 工具。批准后，您应该会看到网络搜索结果包含在响应中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2439deb5fb29e14",
      "translationZh": "图 4：Web Search 工具执行批准对话框",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae8d24beaa359c14",
      "translationZh": "该对话框显示 Claude 想要运行的查询，并提供三个选项：拒绝、仅为此任务允许或仅允许一次。批准后，Web Search 结果将包含在响应中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d8a535be67089dc",
      "translationZh": "如果您在跟随学习过程中创建了资源，请执行以下步骤删除它们：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6ae9114c0ba62a1",
      "translationZh": "最后，在管理账户的 IAM Identity Center 控制台中，删除您在第 2 步中创建的 SAML 应用程序。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3886b2188bcfe9f9",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们演示了如何在 AgentCore 上将 Web Search 与 Claude Desktop 集成。虽然本演练使用 AWS IAM Identity Center 作为身份提供者，但同样的模式适用于任何 SAML 或 OIDC 兼容的身份提供者。您可以通过将其配置为 Amazon Cognito 中的联合来源来替换您现有的 IdP。这种方法在不引入第三方依赖的情况下填补了 Web Search 的空白，并且所有查询都保留在您的 AWS 边界内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07495435a9d05f3e",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请按照上面的步骤在您自己的环境中设置集成。有关高级网关配置，请参阅 AgentCore Gateway 开发者指南。要了解有关 Web Search 的更多信息，请参阅 Web Search 文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
